        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                               <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/217313bb1957b487612de5db7c33a24b.poster.avif?t=1763951849\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/217313bb1957b487612de5db7c33a24b.webm?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/217313bb1957b487612de5db7c33a24b.mp4?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The ultimate word-based roguelike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dicey Words is a dice-based word-building roguelike where strategy, vocabulary, and a little luck collide. Spelling words isn’t always enough!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll letter dice, lock and reroll like Yahtzee, and craft five-letter words for big points. Every decision matters—what letters you keep, what words you build, and how you use the powerful badges you earn along the way. Each run is a fresh challenge packed with risk, reward, and ever-evolving mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/7ac14724b3b3db286d9ac31ea599f635.poster.avif?t=1763951849\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/7ac14724b3b3db286d9ac31ea599f635.webm?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/7ac14724b3b3db286d9ac31ea599f635.mp4?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think fast, spell smart. Every roll is a puzzle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your loadout with over <strong>83 unique badges</strong> that bend the rules, boost your score, or twist the way dice behave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on <strong>21 challenging bosses</strong> across <strong>6 levels of difficulty</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade letters for permanent perks with a unique letter sacrifice system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>6 specialized dice types</strong> that add layers of strategy to every roll.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your runs with <strong>23 powerful perks</strong> to build your perfect word engine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/a5f2442df9fc51cc9ec6d966d406acff.poster.avif?t=1763951849\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/a5f2442df9fc51cc9ec6d966d406acff.webm?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/a5f2442df9fc51cc9ec6d966d406acff.mp4?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a word game fanatic or a roguelike addict, <strong>Dicey Words</strong> delivers fast-paced, brain-twisting gameplay with endless replayability. Each roll is a gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/ed3a4487d53da65c9aa0745ba476daca.poster.avif?t=1763951849\" width=750 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/ed3a4487d53da65c9aa0745ba476daca.webm?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/ed3a4487d53da65c9aa0745ba476daca.mp4?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                               <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/217313bb1957b487612de5db7c33a24b.poster.avif?t=1763951849\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/217313bb1957b487612de5db7c33a24b.webm?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/217313bb1957b487612de5db7c33a24b.mp4?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The ultimate word-based roguelike.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dicey Words is a dice-based word-building roguelike where strategy, vocabulary, and a little luck collide. Spelling words isn’t always enough!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll letter dice, lock and reroll like Yahtzee, and craft five-letter words for big points. Every decision matters—what letters you keep, what words you build, and how you use the powerful badges you earn along the way. Each run is a fresh challenge packed with risk, reward, and ever-evolving mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/7ac14724b3b3db286d9ac31ea599f635.poster.avif?t=1763951849\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/7ac14724b3b3db286d9ac31ea599f635.webm?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/7ac14724b3b3db286d9ac31ea599f635.mp4?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think fast, spell smart. Every roll is a puzzle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your loadout with over <strong>83 unique badges</strong> that bend the rules, boost your score, or twist the way dice behave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on <strong>21 challenging bosses</strong> across <strong>6 levels of difficulty</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade letters for permanent perks with a unique letter sacrifice system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover <strong>6 specialized dice types</strong> that add layers of strategy to every roll.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your runs with <strong>23 powerful perks</strong> to build your perfect word engine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/a5f2442df9fc51cc9ec6d966d406acff.poster.avif?t=1763951849\" width=750 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/a5f2442df9fc51cc9ec6d966d406acff.webm?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/a5f2442df9fc51cc9ec6d966d406acff.mp4?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a word game fanatic or a roguelike addict, <strong>Dicey Words</strong> delivers fast-paced, brain-twisting gameplay with endless replayability. Each roll is a gamble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/ed3a4487d53da65c9aa0745ba476daca.poster.avif?t=1763951849\" width=750 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/ed3a4487d53da65c9aa0745ba476daca.webm?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3797300/extras/ed3a4487d53da65c9aa0745ba476daca.mp4?t=1763951849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
